# Hatchet: nil; the tachi alone (299): 180 (unfinished; kept). 179, option 2: the quest dropped, the guide and the map
# taken. Available again, 178 performed this zone: ignored: 165. ed (a Samurai, skill 2500, no tachi): 178, option 1
# with a full inventory: giveItem false: not begun; out of Norg and back: 178, option 1: the tachi given, begun. fred
